  "_readme": "One entry per theme. 'label' is shown in the Customize panel. 'images' is a list of 2560x1440 (2K) image URLs offered as background choices for that theme — add, remove, or replace any URL here and reload the new tab page to see the change. The first image in the list is used by default the first time someone picks that theme. 'custom' now ships with its own starter photos too, on top of whatever a person uploads from their device or pastes as a URL. Leave 'images' as an empty array to make a theme use a flat color background with no photo choices.",
